\end{proof}

\begin{definition}[Threshold at $\theta = \pi/6$ in calibrated form]
\label{def:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_1_C_2:hbarOmegaMinAtPiDivSix}
\lean{IPhO2026_1_C_2.hbarOmegaMinAtPiDivSix}
\uses{lem:IPhO2026Problems_problem_IPhO_2026_1_C_2:angular_factor_at_pi_div_six}
The C.1 threshold specialized to $\theta = \pi/6$, as a function of the rest
scale $mc^2$ and of the dimensionless ratio $r = \Delta U/(3 m c^2)$:
